{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"You're not from here, are you? There have been more people on the road than usual lately. They say the Church is calling for pilgrims.","zh":"你是外地来的吧？这阵子路上的人比往年多，听说是教会在召朝圣的人。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"It gets dark earlier every day. Our lamp oil used to last till spring; this year I doubt it will see midwinter.","zh":"天黑得一天比一天早了。我家的灯油往年能点到开春，今年怕是撑不到冬至。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Pilgrims come into the city every day now. The inns have been full for weeks, and plenty of them sleep out on the squares.","zh":"这阵子天天有朝圣的人进城，客栈早就住满了，好多人只能在广场上过夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk4.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk4"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk4.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk4"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk5","type":"actor/person/elder","name":{"en":"Aurelian Dawncroft","zh":"奥勒良·曙园"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.goldwood.home-4","x":3,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":73,"household":"holy.goldwood.h3","purse":5,"favourite":"item/food/meat/cooked"},"contents":["holy.goldwood.folk5.coin0","holy.goldwood.folk5.coin1","holy.goldwood.folk5.coin2","holy.goldwood.folk5.coin3","holy.goldwood.folk5.coin4"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.cropped","face":"face.weary","beard":"beard.full","age":"age.lined","outfit":"outfit.tunic","legs":"legs.wraps","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"porcelain","hair":"silver","eyes":"hazel","outfit.1":"ochre","legs.1":"undyed","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"elder","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":5,"map":"holy.goldwood.home-4","x":4,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"holy.goldwood.home-4","x":3,"y":2,"activity":"sit"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"holy.goldwood.home-4","x":7,"y":5,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"holy.goldwood.home-4","x":3,"y":2,"activity":"sit"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"holy.goldwood.home-4","x":7,"y":5,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Sit down, sit down, don't stand there. My legs aren't what they were, and looking up at you hurts my neck.","zh":"坐吧，坐吧，别站着。我这腿不中用了，仰着头跟你说话，脖子疼。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"When I was small, at this time of year it was still light after supper, and we would play outside a good while. Now it's dark before supper is even cooked.","zh":"我小时候，这个时节吃完晚饭天还亮着，我们还能在外面玩好一阵。现在饭还没做好，天就黑了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Mind your purse in the crowd by the gate.","zh":"城门边人多，看好你的钱袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk5.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk5"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk5.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk5"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk5.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk5"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk5.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk5"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk5.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk5"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk6","type":"actor/person/fisher","name":{"en":"Marcus Dawncroft","zh":"马库斯·曙园"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.goldwood","x":18,"y":15},"facing":"down","props":{"age":38,"household":"holy.goldwood.h3","purse":6,"favourite":"item/gem","stock":"item/food/fish/raw*3|item/misc/bait*3"},"tags":["merchant"],"contents":["holy.goldwood.folk6.s0.0","holy.goldwood.folk6.s0.1","holy.goldwood.folk6.s0.2","holy.goldwood.folk6.s1.0","holy.goldwood.folk6.s1.1","holy.goldwood.folk6.s1.2","holy.goldwood.folk6.coin0","holy.goldwood.folk6.coin1","holy.goldwood.folk6.coin2"