年多，听说是教会在召朝圣的人。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"Up already? The bakery isn't open yet. I want the first batch; flour is short, and by mid-morning there's nothing left.","zh":"这么早就起了？面包房还没开门呢。我得赶第一炉，这阵子面粉紧，晚了就买不着了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Pilgrims come into the city every day now. The inns have been full for weeks, and plenty of them sleep out on the squares.","zh":"这阵子天天有朝圣的人进城，客栈早就住满了，好多人只能在广场上过夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk11.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk11"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk11.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk11"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk11.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk11"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk11.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk11"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk11.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk11"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk11.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.goldwood.folk11"}},{"id":"holy.goldwood.folk12","type":"actor/person/villager","name":{"en":"Aurelia Laureldale","zh":"奥蕾莉娅·桂谷"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.goldwood.home-7","x":1,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":51,"household":"holy.goldwood.h6","purse":5,"favourite":"item/food/ale"},"contents":["holy.goldwood.folk12.coin0","holy.goldwood.folk12.coin1","holy.goldwood.folk12.coin2","holy.goldwood.folk12.coin3","holy.goldwood.folk12.coin4"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.tied","face":"face.soft","outfit":"outfit.shawl","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"porcelain","hair":"umber","eyes":"amber","outfit.1":"indigo","outfit.2":"steelgrey","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"villager","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":7,"map":"holy.goldwood.home-7","x":1,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"holy.goldwood","x":33,"y":15,"a